      "value": "Improvised Manaweaving Wands"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "If I'm ever in a pinch, I'm pretty sure I can fashion a simple "
        },
        {
          "text": "Improvised Manaweaving Wand",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " using something as a rod and something as a focus.  There are probably quite a few items that will suffice for either. \n\nThis should allow me to do emergency manaweaving, but likely will "
        },
        {
          "text": "break after more than a few uses",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". \n\nHowever, I can probably get a "
        },
        {
          "text": "cantrip",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " or a "
        },
        {
          "text": "ritual",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " out of it before it breaks, and that might make all the difference."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
